<title>USA: Hesperia USD, Calif. yields 5.50 in 2006.</title>
<headline>Hesperia USD, Calif. yields 5.50 in 2006.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stone &amp; Youngberg said it priced $2.085 million of Hesperia Unified Sch Dist, Calif., with a top yield of 5.50 percent in 2006.</p>
